        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is Alani Nu protein good for weight loss?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "It can fit a weight-loss diet because one scoop of Fruity Cereal gives 23 g of protein for 110 calories, and higher-protein diets tend to help people feel full. But no powder causes weight loss by itself; your total calories decide that. Alani has marketed the powder as a meal replacement, but one scoop alone is not a full meal, so pair it with food."
