      "alani nu whey protein",
      "is alani protein third party tested"
    ],
  }}
  jsonLd={schema}
  stickyCta={{
    text: "See Our Top Whey Isolate Picks",
    link: "/best-whey-protein-isolate/",
  }}
>
  <article class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <ArticleHeader kicker={"Brand Review"} badge={"Label-Checked"} author={author} dates={dates} mobileAd={false}>
      <Fragment slot="title">Alani Protein Powder Review</Fragment>
      A label-first look at Alani Nu Whey Protein: what is in the isolate and hydrolysate blend, where you can still buy it, what Alani says about testing, and what it costs per 25 g of protein.
    </ArticleHeader>

    <TableOfContents>
